Third-party components downloaded at install time. They are NOT included in
this repository, so the MIT license above does not cover them:

  AstrBot   https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/AstrBot   AGPL-3.0
  NapCat    https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ      "Limited Redistribution
            License for NapCat" (not an OSI license; includes a
            non-commercial clause and restricts redistribution)
  Python    https://www.nuget.org/packages/python    PSF-2.0

The install script fetches each of them from its official release page. It
does not redistribute them, which is what keeps this repo clean.

Do NOT repackage this project into an offline bundle that already contains
NapCat (or the AstrBot dashboard build) and then redistribute that bundle --
NapCat's license requires the author's permission for redistribution and
forbids commercial use. Downloading at install time avoids the question
entirely, so keep it that way.
